      "allocationTiming": "Allocated on the Developer website when iOS re-arms under ADR-024, together with the four iOS App IDs that are this record's only consumers. Not created at Ceremony C1: no C1-authorized App ID needs the App Groups capability (rule G4), and creating a record no authorized identifier consumes is portal mutation without a function.",
