    "policy": "A consumer computes the per-target, per-channel allowlist as: authored keys (status in authoredStatuses) UNION signingGenerated[platform].always UNION, only when the channel is development, signingGenerated[platform].developmentChannelOnly. Keys with a non-authored status are never in the allowlist.",
    "unknownKeyPolicy": "fail-closed — an unexpected key is a finding for TASK-260715-3jloqy or TASK-260715-uyju7n to resolve against this contract, never a silent local exception."
