    "prohibitedKeyPolicy": "None of these may be authored by any target or appear in any signed bundle on any channel. A future need is an amendment to this contract under rule 11, never a local build setting.",
    "getTaskAllowNote": "com.apple.security.get-task-allow / get-task-allow are deliberately NOT in prohibitedKeys: they are injected by the toolchain on the development channel and stripped on distribution export. They are governed by entitlementClassification.signingGenerated and assertion A10d instead.",
    "sparkleNestedCodeNote": "Sparkle's own nested code — Sparkle.framework, Installer.xpc, Downloader.xpc, Autoupdate, Updater.app — carries entitlements authored by Sparkle, not by this matrix. Rule X1 and assertions A10a-A10e apply to this project's four production targets and its probe targets, never to third-party nested code. Re-signing that nested code on Developer ID export is owned by TASK-260715-3gkwn0 and TASK-260717-xempiv.",
    "conditionalExceptions": [
      {
        "id": "X1-C1",
        "key": "com.apple.security.temporary-exception.files.absolute-path.read-write",
        "target": "macos.provider",
        "valuesIfArmed": [
